WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Hi, I'm Sara from A9 Voice.

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.461
Let's record your first
meeting — no bot joins,

3
00:00:05.501 --> 00:00:07.981
and there's nothing to set up in the call.

4
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:14.286
Open Notes and press Record — or
press Control, Alt, N from anywhere.

5
00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:21.155
Or let it start by itself: when a meeting app you've
turned on holds your microphone for five seconds,

6
00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:25.177
A9 Voice begins recording — and gives
you eight seconds to discard it.

7
00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:28.338
A small bar sits on top while you record.

8
00:00:28.378 --> 00:00:31.646
It captures your microphone
and your computer's audio,

9
00:00:31.686 --> 00:00:34.464
and keeps them apart —
you, and everyone else.

10
00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:36.283
Want to follow along?

11
00:00:36.323 --> 00:00:39.229
The Live window shows the
transcript as people talk.

12
00:00:40.733 --> 00:00:44.924
When the call ends, A9 Voice
stops by itself — or press Stop.

13
00:00:44.964 --> 00:00:47.975
The transcript comes
first, then the summary

14
00:00:48.015 --> 00:00:50.194
with decisions and action items.

15
00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:53.113
That's it.

16
00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:55.346
Your meeting notes write themselves.
